Docstring-only change. With doc comments blanked, every file is
byte-identical; every declaration header is byte-identical.

Formulas: each of the 188 public declarations that the review's docaudit
listed as NO-FORMULA now has a backticked formula transcribed from its
statement. The target lamport_oneTimeSecure keeps its prose first line,
tag and header. Per file (formulas / proof sketches added):
  Lamport.lean                       18 / 1
  Lamport/Advice.lean                 9 / 0
  Lamport/Averaging.lean              4 / 0
  Lamport/AveragingExtra.lean         2 / 0
  Lamport/Closing.lean                1 / 0
  Lamport/Encoding.lean               1 / 0
  Lamport/Experiment.lean            18 / 2
  Lamport/InversionProbability.lean   1 / 0
  Lamport/Machine.lean               62 / 0
  Lamport/MachineSpec.lean            8 / 3
  Lamport/Nonabort.lean               1 / 0
  Lamport/Planted.lean               49 / 1
  Lamport/Realization.lean            5 / 0
  Lamport/Seed.lean                   5 / 0
  Lamport/Statistics.lean             1 / 0
  Lamport/TableCoins.lean             3 / 0
  total                             188 / 7

Proof sketches: both proofs of 15 or more lines without a sketch
(runAt_lamportGen_table, favourable_mass_of_success), plus five of the
six 10-14-line ones (diagonal_red_of_success_favourable, first_context,
second_context, out_nonabort, tableSignature_plant_of_safe).
runAt_lamportSign_table (10 lines) has none, because Lamport.lean must
stay under 1000 lines.

Lamport.lean goes from 973 to 999 lines; its edited first paragraphs
are refilled from their start to keep it compact. No line is over 100
characters except the existing Lamport.lean:90. Authentication.lean
and the run_cmd opacity blocks are not touched.

